Create TWO completely different anime illustrations from the uploaded everyday photo while preserving the same person's identity. Keep the facial shape, facial feature proportions, recognizable hairstyle, age impression, and overall personality consistent, but fully transform the image into a vibrant, high-quality anime style. Both images should be unmistakably animated rather than photorealistic, with expressive linework, clean cel shading, bold graphic shadows, vivid high-saturation colours, crisp facial detail, and a polished poster-quality finish.

IMAGE 1 — {argument name="style one" default="Urban Pop Anime"}
A playful, energetic anime poster with a dramatic wide-angle perspective and dynamic pose. The character has an expressive smile, lively hand gesture, and confident body language. Reimagine the background as a colourful anime city filled with neon signs, floating hearts, sparkling stars, comic speech bubbles, motion lines, kawaii stickers, tiny mascots, hand-drawn doodles, colourful geometric graphics, and fun sound effects. The composition should feel youthful, exciting, bold, and instantly eye-catching, with excellent visual hierarchy and strong social-media appeal.

IMAGE 2 — {argument name="style two" default="Dreamy Fantasy Anime"}
Create a completely different composition with a magical fantasy atmosphere. Use a cinematic low-angle perspective and graceful, expressive pose with flowing movement. Replace the original background with a whimsical fantasy world featuring glowing skies, floating islands, oversized flowers, magical sparkles, butterflies, glowing stars, cute fantasy creatures, ribbons, clouds, colourful gradients, decorative frames, and elegant anime-inspired graphic elements. The mood should feel charming, emotional, imaginative, and visually rich while maintaining a clean silhouette, expressive face, polished illustration quality, and a vibrant, premium anime aesthetic suitable for viral social-media artwork.

Theme direction: {argument name="theme" default="Oriental Zen minimalist poster"}
Style branch: High-contrast night type
Main content: {argument name="main subject" default="A person standing under green eaves looking at lanterns"}
Emotional motif: Warm night, festive feeling, relaxed feeling
Scenes and imagery: Coral orange lanterns, indigo night sky, moon-white negative space, green eaves, character silhouettes
Composition and space: Upper part is indigo night sky and lanterns, lower part is eaves and character, with a large amount of vertical space left in the frame
Color control: Moon-white for fog layers and transition space, indigo for the night sky, coral orange for the lantern body and local halo, ink-green for eaves and character structure; avoid the whole image being too dark
Light and texture: Clear night light, warm light, light grain, digital oriental poster feel
Aspect ratio: {argument name="aspect ratio" default="9:16"}
Supplementary requirements: Control the number of lanterns to a small amount, make the screen bright, and don't make it into a crowded lantern festival

Theme direction: {argument name="theme" default="Oriental Zen minimalist poster"}
Style branch: High-contrast communicative type
Main content: A figure sitting in a slender bamboo boat, with a small paper lantern placed by their hand
Emotional motif: A sense of floating, warmth in silence, poetic
Scene and imagery: {argument name="color imagery" default="Lake blue water surface, orange-gold paper lantern, off-white mist layer, bamboo boat, figure"}
Composition and space: Horizontal layered composition, with the water occupying most of the space, the bamboo boat located in the lower-middle part, leaving an open field around it
Color control: Off-white for the mist layer and transition base, lake blue for the water surface and distant air layer, orange-gold only for the paper lantern and local water reflection, dark grey for the bamboo boat and figure structure; avoid the whole image leaning too blue or too orange
Light and texture: Clear soft light, slight water texture, light grain, digital Oriental poster texture
Aspect ratio: {argument name="ratio" default="9:16"}
Supplementary requirements: The bamboo boat should be slender and simple, the paper lantern is a small but bright focal point, and the overall image should not be darkened

Theme Direction: {argument name="theme" default="Oriental Zen Minimalist Poster"}
